{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104916","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104916/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104916/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104916/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104916","id":2966006290,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6REb0O","number":104916,"title":"Move notification handler logic from `GDCLASS` to `GDCLASS_RECEIVE_NOTIFICATIONS`, making receiving notifications explicit.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","color":"b64245","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T12:11:16Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-04-02T10:55:04Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:10:31Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104916","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104916","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104916.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104916.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Notifications are currently 'subscribed to' by declaring the magical `_notification` function.\r\nTo accomodate this, every `GDCLASS` overrides `_notification_forwardv` and `_notification_backwardv`, which is wasteful and somewhat confusing.\r\n\r\nInstead, I propose to make subscribing to notifications explicit, by declaring `GDCLASS_RECEIVE_NOTIFICATIONS`. \r\nI don't think it will have noticeable performance impact (although it may be slightly favorable due to code caches). Similar changes could be applied to other \"magic\" functions, like `_bind_methods`.\r\n\r\nIn turn, it's a breaking change for modules, and a harsh one at that: I don't think it will be possible to statically fail to notify updaters they have to change code (or at least, I didn't find any way to).\r\n\r\nCurrently, I'm thinking to keep this idea for 5.x since there's no tangible benefit to it now, and it's a little annoying for updaters. That's why I'm making it a draft.\r\nBut I'd like to hear other people's opinion :)\r\n\r\n## Implementation side note\r\nAlmost all code updates are a single search replace:\r\n```\r\nvoid _notification\\(int p_what\\)\\;\r\nvoid _notification(int p_what);\\n\\tGDCLASS_RECEIVE_NOTIFICATIONS(_notification);\r\n```","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104916/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104916/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}